    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>Avante! Atlantis</strong>, a tactical turn-based game with a striking board game look and a world on the edge of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid global conflict and scarce resources, the lost city of Atlantis has mysteriously resurfaced. Rich in natural resources, it quickly becomes the focus of every major nation\u2019s ambitions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Atlantis didn\u2019t return by chance. As battles rage across its ruins, a deeper mystery begins to unfold...one that could reshape the world. <br><br>Why has Atlantis come back now? And what purpose does it truly serve?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your forces, uncover hidden truths, and fight for control in <strong>Avante! Atlantis</strong>, where every move counts, and the legend is only beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/340878410bcc9f86f1585fbce805010f.poster.avif?t=1755102434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/340878410bcc9f86f1585fbce805010f.webm?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/340878410bcc9f86f1585fbce805010f.mp4?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Campaign:</strong> Embark on an epic journey through Atlantis, battling foes and uncovering the mysteries behind the city\u2019s long-hidden secrets;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/04640cc68902d293659edf95f45bd6e4.poster.avif?t=1755102434\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/04640cc68902d293659edf95f45bd6e4.webm?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/04640cc68902d293659edf95f45bd6e4.mp4?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many ways to Play!:</strong> Battle solo  or compete with friends in exciting matches! Play locally or over LAN for an intense and thrilling experience. Up to 4 Players in a match!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/861228cecb0ffbabc41bd08240c281cc.poster.avif?t=1755102434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/861228cecb0ffbabc41bd08240c281cc.webm?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/861228cecb0ffbabc41bd08240c281cc.mp4?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Board Game Experience:</strong> Roll the dice for victory! Each roll can slightly boost or reduce your unit\u2019s base power, adding a small layer of unpredictability to your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/29248b074864fe64d40559a0dd0078b9.poster.avif?t=1755102434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/29248b074864fe64d40559a0dd0078b9.webm?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/29248b074864fe64d40559a0dd0078b9.mp4?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Biomes:</strong> Battle across four distinct environments, each featuring unique tiles, like the life-restoring Oasis or the fragile Ice that can shatter beneath your units at any moment!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/dc4258ced5715ddb44cf7d264b013cac.poster.avif?t=1755102434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/dc4258ced5715ddb44cf7d264b013cac.webm?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/dc4258ced5715ddb44cf7d264b013cac.mp4?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commanders</strong>: Choose from 8 charming and unique Commanders, each with a special ability to turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/716e3f255310eee7d3cbc7f724a0217f.avif?t=1755102434\" data-has-big width=800 height=404 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Units: </strong>Command a diverse arsenal to secure victory! From classic Infantry and Tanks to unique units like Drills and Magnets, each brings its own strategic role to the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/a9468708c2c5aebca600c68bf40e8e3b.poster.avif?t=1755102434\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/a9468708c2c5aebca600c68bf40e8e3b.webm?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/a9468708c2c5aebca600c68bf40e8e3b.mp4?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Map Editor:</strong> Unleash your creativity with the map editor! Design and share your own custom maps, using all the tools the game offers to craft exciting battlefields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise to the challenge, defeating your enemies and claiming Atlantis? Will the legendary city yield to your might? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure awaits<br><strong><i>Avante</i></strong> to glory!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>Avante! Atlantis</strong>, a tactical turn-based game with a striking board game look and a world on the edge of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid global conflict and scarce resources, the lost city of Atlantis has mysteriously resurfaced. Rich in natural resources, it quickly becomes the focus of every major nation\u2019s ambitions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Atlantis didn\u2019t return by chance. As battles rage across its ruins, a deeper mystery begins to unfold...one that could reshape the world. <br><br>Why has Atlantis come back now? And what purpose does it truly serve?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your forces, uncover hidden truths, and fight for control in <strong>Avante! Atlantis</strong>, where every move counts, and the legend is only beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/340878410bcc9f86f1585fbce805010f.poster.avif?t=1755102434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/340878410bcc9f86f1585fbce805010f.webm?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/340878410bcc9f86f1585fbce805010f.mp4?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Campaign:</strong> Embark on an epic journey through Atlantis, battling foes and uncovering the mysteries behind the city\u2019s long-hidden secrets;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin