aph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/a9468708c2c5aebca600c68bf40e8e3b.poster.avif?t=1755102434\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/a9468708c2c5aebca600c68bf40e8e3b.webm?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/a9468708c2c5aebca600c68bf40e8e3b.mp4?t=1755102434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Map Editor:</strong> Unleash your creativity with the map editor! Design and share your own custom maps, using all the tools the game offers to craft exciting battlefields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise to the challenge, defeating your enemies and claiming Atlantis? Will the legendary city yield to your might? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure awaits<br><strong><i>Avante</i></strong> to glory!</p>",
